{"children": [{"object": "block", "type": "heading_2", "heading_2": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "实例演练: 4x4 DCT2 二维逆变换全过程"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "以下用一个完整的4x4 TU实例展示: 输入X -> 垂直变换Y -> 水平变换Z 的全过程"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "divider", "divider": {}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_3", "heading_3": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "1. 输入矩阵 X (TU的频域系数, 来自it_data_in, 存进in_mem)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "X[0]: 100  20  50  30"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "X[1]:  25  10  15   5"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "X[2]:  60  40  80  70"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "X[3]:  15  35  45  55"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "16个频域系数, 稀疏传输只传非零点. 未传的地址在S_CLEAR阶段已清零"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "divider", "divider": {}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_3", "heading_3": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "2. 变换矩阵 T (DCT2 N=4, ROM[0..15])"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "DCT2公式: T[i][j] = i==0?64:round(89*cos(pi*i*(2j+1)/8))"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "T[0]:  64   64   64   64   (i=0, DC分量为64)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "T[1]:  82   34  -34  -82"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "T[2]:  63  -63  -63   63"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "T[3]:  34  -82   82  -34"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "base_addr=0 ({tr_type=DCT2, size=4})"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "T^T (转置, 垂直逆变换用):"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  行0: 64  82  63  34"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  行1: 64  34 -63 -82"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  行2: 64 -34 -63  82"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  行3: 64 -82  63 -34"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "divider", "divider": {}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_3", "heading_3": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "3. 垂直逆变换: Y = T^T x X (对每列做一维变换)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "硬件: S_ROW_START -> S_ROW_RUN, 4列各跑一次transform_engine"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "第0列输入 [100,25,60,15]:"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  Y[0][0]=64x100+82x25+63x60+34x15=12740"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  Y[1][0]=64x100+34x25+(-63)x60+(-82)x15=2240"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  Y[2][0]=64x100+(-34)x25+(-63)x60+82x15=3000"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  Y[3][0]=64x100+(-82)x25+63x60+(-34)x15=7620"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "第1列 [20,10,40,35]: Y[0][1]=5810, Y[1][1]=-3770, Y[2][1]=1290, Y[3][1]=1790"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "第2列 [50,15,80,45]: Y[0][2]=11000, Y[1][2]=-5020, Y[2][2]=1340, Y[3][2]=5480"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "第3列 [30,5,70,55]: Y[0][3]=8610, Y[1][3]=-6830, Y[2][3]=1850, Y[3][3]=4050"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "Y = [12740,5810,11000,8610; 2240,-3770,-5020,-6830; 3000,1290,1340,1850; 7620,1790,5480,4050]"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "关键: Y[0][0]=12740只用了第0列的4个数, 跟第1/2/3列完全无关"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "只做垂直变换:每个Y值只跟自己那一列的4个X有关, 缺少行方向关联 -- 不是完整二维变换"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "divider", "divider": {}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_3", "heading_3": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "4. 水平逆变换: Z = Y x T (对每行做一维变换)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "硬件: S_COL_START -> S_COL_RUN, 4行各跑一次transform_engine"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "Z[0][0] = Y行0 x T列0 = Y[0][0]xT[0][0] + Y[0][1]xT[1][0] + Y[0][2]xT[2][0] + Y[0][3]xT[3][0]"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  = 12740x64 + 5810x82 + 11000x63 + 8610x34 = 2277520"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  量化: (2277520+32)>>6 = 35586"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "Z[0][1] = 12740x64 + 5810x34 + 11000x(-34) + 8610x(-82) = -6033"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "Z[0][2] = 12740x64 + 5810x(-34) + 11000x(-63) + 8610x82 = 9857"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "Z[0][3] = 12740x64 + 5810x(-82) + 11000x63 + 8610x(-34) = 11550"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "Z = [35586,-6033,9857,11550; -11160,13930,433,5757; 6955,-4,3366,1683; 17459,-2012,6464,8569]"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "每个Z元素4次乘加(Z=YxT). 每个Y元素又来自4个X -> 间接关联全部16个X"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "divider", "divider": {}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_3", "heading_3": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "5. 为什么>>6 (右移6位 = 除以64)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "ROM系数是放大取整的: round(89*0.9239)=82, 而非小数0.9239"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "一次一维变换后累加器被放大. 两次变换后值变成原始像素的几千倍"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "(+32)>>>6: +32四舍五入, >>>6除以64还原到正确像素范围"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "DCT2用64定标, DCT8/DST7用64, LFNST用128. 不同放大倍数配合不同右移量"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "这个值是VVC标准写死的, 不是设计者选的"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "divider", "divider": {}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_3", "heading_3": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "6. 总结: 为什么先垂直后水平 = 完整二维变换"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "垂直变换: 每一列的4个X混合 -> Y, 建立列内关联"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "水平变换: 每一行的4个Y混合 -> Z, 建立行内关联"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "两步走完: Z里每个像素值都跟全部16个X有关 = 完整二维变换"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "共用同一套transform_engine: 垂直时size=tu_height, 水平时size=tu_width"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "引擎只看得到列向量, 上层通过改变数据读取方向(按列/按行)来实现垂直/水平切换"}}]}}]}